## PROGRESSIVE CONTEXT RULE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

The conversation builds context progressively. Each turn adds detail.
Do NOT treat each message in isolation — synthesize all turns together.

Example:
  Turn 1: "Soap & bathing"    → industry = "Soap and personal care"
  Turn 2: "Marketing"         → function = "Marketing"
  Turn 3: "Brand marketing"   → specialization = "Brand Marketing"
  Turn 4: "Soap/shampoo specifically" → refines industry to "Soap and shampoo"
  Turn 5: "Professional career"       → career_intent = "professional"
  Turn 6: "Marketing strategy"        → specialization = "Brand Marketing and Strategy"

After Turn 6:
  target_role = "Brand Marketing Strategist"
  goal_summary = "Build a professional career in brand marketing and strategy within the soap and shampoo industry"

